OL,3,GNEWSAUnion urges support for UK's
OL,4,Alargest gas store
OL,5,
OL,6,FA union has called on the government
OL,7,Fand energy firm Centrica to work
OL,8,Ftogether to secure the future of the
OL,9,FUK's largest gas storage facility.
OL,11,FThe Rough facility, situated 18 miles
OL,12,F(29km) off the East Yorkshire coast,
OL,13,Faccounts for about half of the capacity
OL,14,Fthe UK has to store gas.
OL,16,FCentrica - which owns British Gas -
OL,17,Fwants to invest #2bn in the facility so
OL,18,Fit can store more gas, with a
OL,19,Flonger-term ambition to store hydrogen,
OL,20,Fbut is seeking government support.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
