OL,3,GNEWSAUnion urges support for UK's
OL,4,Alargest gas store
OL,5,
OL,6,FUnite said there were concerns Centrica
OL,7,Fwould close the facility unless the
OL,8,Fgovernment agrees a new funding
OL,9,Fformula, leading to the loss of 100
OL,10,Fskilled jobs, along with a further 350
OL,11,Fjobs in the supply chain.
